# The menus in short landscape at DPR 3: Help, Settings (left-handed on and
# off), Scores (device bests for a guest), Practice Easy with the hint (from
# the worker), a dispatch and undo, pause and resume by Escape, Restart
# round, Leave round, then Challenge and the Daily started and left.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Transit Tangle
frames 30
touch =Help #2
until 300 How to play
frames 10
save tt-help
touch =Close
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =Settings #2
until 300 Color palette
frames 10
touch =Left-handed controls
frames 10
save tt-settings
touch =Left-handed controls
frames 10
touch =Done
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =Scores
until 300 No Journey best yet on this device
frames 10
touch =Close
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =Practice
until 300 Unranked. Undo and hints allowed
frames 10
touch =Easy
frames 200
key KeyH 1
until 2400 Try the
frames 10
save tt-hint
touch Vehicle 1:
frames 8
touch Queue 1:
frames 30
key KeyU 1
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
key Escape 1
frames 20
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
touch =Restart round
frames 160
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
touch =Leave round
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =Challenge
until 300 move limit
frames 10
touch =Start
frames 160
save tt-challenge
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
touch =Leave round
until 300 Daily Challenge
frames 10
touch =Daily Challenge
frames 160
expect daily
key Escape 1
until 300 Paused
frames 10
touch =Leave round
until 300 Daily Challenge
